1
00:03:38,181 --> 00:03:44,181
Two cultures. Two women. One love.

2
00:07:16,363 --> 00:07:22,363
I Can't Think Straight is a drama, romance film directed by Shamim Sarif.

3
00:10:54,545 --> 00:11:00,545
Tala, a London-based Palestinian, is preparing for her elaborate Middle Eastern wedding when
she meets Leyla, a young British Indian woman who is dating her best friend.

4
00:14:32,727 --> 00:14:38,727
Spirited Christian Tala and shy Muslim Leyla could not be more different from each
other, but the attraction is immediate and goes deeper than friendship.

5
00:18:10,909 --> 00:18:16,909
But Tala is not ready to accept the implications of the choice her heart has made for her and escapes back to Jordan,
while Leyla tries to move on with her new-found life, to the shock of her tradition-loving parents.

6
00:21:49,090 --> 00:21:55,090
As Tala's wedding day approaches, simmering tensions come to boiling point
and the pressure mounts for Tala to be true to herself.

7
00:25:27,272 --> 00:25:33,272
Tala, played by Lisa Ray.

8
00:29:05,454 --> 00:29:11,454
Leyla, played by Sheetal Sheth.

9
00:32:43,636 --> 00:32:49,636
Reema, played by Antonia Frering.

10
00:36:21,818 --> 00:36:27,818
Omar, played by Dalip Tahil.

11
00:40:00,000 --> 00:40:06,000
Housekeeper, played by Nina Wadia.

12
00:43:38,181 --> 00:43:44,181
Maya, played by Siddiqua Akhtar.

13
00:47:16,363 --> 00:47:22,363
I Can't Think Straight is a 2008 British romantic
drama film directed by Shamim Sarif.

14
00:50:54,545 --> 00:51:00,545
Based on Sarif's 2008 novel of the same name, the film tells the story of a London-based Jordanian of Palestinian descent, Tala, who is preparing for an
elaborate wedding when a turn of events causes her to have an affair, and subsequently fall in love, with another woman, Leyla, a British Indian.

15
00:54:32,727 --> 00:54:38,727
The film stars Lisa Ray and Sheetal Sheth.

16
00:58:10,909 --> 00:58:16,909
I Can't Think Straight was produced by Enlightenment Productions and
distributed in the United States by Regent Releasing and Here!

17
01:01:49,090 --> 01:01:55,090
It was released in different regions between 2008 and 2009.

18
01:05:27,272 --> 01:05:33,272
The DVD was released on 4 May 2009.

19
01:09:05,454 --> 01:09:11,454
The lead actresses, Ray and Sheth, also starred in Sarif's 2007
lesbian-themed historical drama film The World Unseen.

20
01:12:43,636 --> 01:12:49,636
The film explores themes of lgbt, woman director, lesbian.

21
01:16:21,818 --> 01:16:27,818
The tone is emotional and thought_provoking.
